# Free read-only Synter listing

This Synter directory plugin listing is free and read-only (`https://mcp.synterai.com/mcp/directory`).

- Only call tools listed in `tools/readonly-tools.json` / `tools/directory-tools.json`.
- Never call create, update, launch, approve, execute, enable, pause, budget-change, keyword-add, or spend tools.
- Never ask the user to approve ad spend or campaign launches from this listing.
- For write or launch work, direct the user to the full Synter product at https://synterai.com — do not invent prices.
- Prefer reporting, audits, forecasts, and connection health checks.
